 "description": "Replace a deployment's onion identity while preserving its protection profile and authorized clients. The old address stops serving the app, so existing links no longer lead to it. Retained recovery copies may remain; this does not purge them. Export first if the customer needs an encrypted backup. The new address appears when the agent reports success. Requires manage scope, confirmation of the exact current confirm_address and an agent with onion-custody-v1. If confirm_token is absent from this connection's input schema, use a connection that exposes it or a supported customer-portal flow. A quote or confirmation request is not completion. IRREVERSIBLE \u2014 takes two calls: the first returns a confirm_token and changes nothing, the second repeats the same arguments plus confirm_token and executes.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "confirm": {
    "const": true,
    "type": "boolean"
   },
   "confirm_address": {
    "type": "string"
   },
   "deployment_id": {
    "description": "The dpl_\u2026 deployment id (from impreza_list_deployments).",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "deployment_id",
   "confirm",
   "confirm_address"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "impreza_rotate_onion_key",
